@startuml
hide empty description

[*] --> FirstReliable
FirstReliable : Receive 101-199 with Require: 100rel
FirstReliable : Save RSeq as last received
FirstReliable --> AwaitPRACK : Create PRACK with RAck

AwaitPRACK --> AwaitNext : Matching 2xx to PRACK
AwaitPRACK --> AwaitPRACK : Same dialog ID, CSeq, RSeq\n(retransmission: discard; no new PRACK)

AwaitNext --> AwaitNext : RSeq == last + 1\nprocess and PRACK
AwaitNext --> AwaitNext : RSeq != last + 1\nMUST NOT process/PRACK; discard or cache
AwaitNext --> Done : Final response received

Done --> [*]
@enduml
